The first Level is a simple SSH login to a server.

root@ubuntu:~$ ssh bandit0@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

we always login to port 2220 using the -p 2220 command

bandit0 is the User we are logging into 

bandit.labs.overthewire.org is the server we are logging into

The password is bandit0

Once we are in there is a file named readme

we use the cat command to read it.
  bandit0@bandit:~$ ls
  readme
  bandit0@bandit:~$ cat readme
  Congratulations on your first steps into the bandit game!!
  Please make sure you have read the rules at https://overthewire.org/rules/
